# An allowlist keeps local experiments and credentials out of the build context.
**
!Dockerfile
!LICENSE
!README.md
!pyproject.toml
!src/
!src/**
!environments/
!environments/unified/
!environments/unified/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!recipes/
!recipes/**
!docs/
!docs/ENVIRONMENTS.md
!docs/DOCKER.md
!docs/RAGGED_EXPERTS.md
!docker/
!docker/smoke_test.py
!docker/intdim_vllm_smoke.py
!docker/check_release_tag.py
!tests/
!tests/**

# These exclusions also apply inside the allowed source directories.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
**/*.safetensors
**/*.bin
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/.DS_Store
